  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened Accountability in Zambia - Diakonia - Diakonia Zambia</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xe4;rkt ansvarsutkr&#xe4;vande i Zambia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Diakonia har ans&#xf6;kt om finansiering fr&#xe5;n Sida om SEK 19 035 000 f&#xf6;r att utf&#xf6;ra rogrammet &#x201d;F&#xf6;rst&#xe4;rkt ansvarsutkr&#xe4;vande i Zambia&#x201d; fr&#xe5;n 2014 till 2017. Interventionen syftar till att ge  r&#xe4;ttighetshavare &#xf6;kad tillg&#xe5;ng till resurser genom samarbete med den privata och offentliga sektorn. Programmet har fyra f&#xf6;rv&#xe4;ntade utfall: (i) att den deltagande privata sektorn agerar p&#xe5; ett transparent s&#xe4;tt, tar ansvar gentemot r&#xe4;ttighetshavarna och bidrar till socio-ekonomisk r&#xe4;ttvisa i utvalda distrikt i Nord V&#xe4;stra provinsen; (ii), att deltagande lokala statliga myndigheter f&#xf6;rs&#xe4;krar att de offentliga resurserna anv&#xe4;nds p&#xe5; ett transparant och ansvarsfullt s&#xe4;tt och &#xf6;ppnar upp f&#xf6;r samh&#xe4;llsdeltagande i planerings- och utvecklingsprocesser; (iii) att internationella institutioner samt nationella och lokala myndigheter f&#xf6;rs&#xe4;krar att det r&#xe4;ttsliga regelverket uppr&#xe4;tth&#xe5;lls, respekteras och f&#xf6;ljs av f&#xf6;retagssektorn, lokala statliga institutioner och traditionella ledare f&#xf6;r transparant och ansvarsfullt utnyttjande av resurser; och (iv) att partnerorganisationerna f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrar sina interna och externa system och processer f&#xf6;r intern demokrati och effektivt genomf&#xf6;rande av sina program. 

Sida kommer att finansiera hela programmet medan Diakonia kommer att bidra i form av utbildning genom tekniskt st&#xf6;d fr&#xe5;n sitt regionala ekonomiska r&#xe4;ttighetsprogram i Nairobi. 

Diakonia has applied for funding from Sida of SEK19 035 000 to carry out the Strengthened Accountability in Zambia programme from 2014 to 2017.

The intervention aims at empowering right holders to have increased access to resources through engagement with corporate and public sectors.The programme has four expected outcomes:
(i) Targeted corporate sector acts in a transparent manner, is accountable to the rights holders and contributing to socio-economic justice in targeted districts of North-Western Province. (ii) Targeted local state authorities ensure that public resources are used in a transparent and accountable way and provide for community participation in planning and development processes (iii) International institutions, National and local authorities ensure that the legal framework is enforced, respected and followed by the corporate sector, local state institutions and traditional leaders for transparent and accountable utilization of resources; and (iv) Partner organizations improve their internal and external systems and processes for internal democracy and effective implementation of their programmes. 

Sida will fund the whole programme while Diakonia will contribute in kind towards the training through technical support from its regional economic justice program.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to civil society to empower rights holders to engage with     Coporate  and public sectors for accountability and increased access  to resources.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the programme is empowered right holders have increased access to resources through engagement with corporate and public sectors.</narrative>
  </description>
